  "sky5F": "sky5F.png is not 16 px per tile -- map 51's content is 15x56 tiles, which at 16 px would be 896 tall against the image's 414. Tiamat's pixel upstream/Sun cannot be reproduced by a single 16 px region, so no entry is guessed here.",
  "bahamut": "bahamut.png is one image for two ROM maps, 17 and 39 stacked. Bahamut himself is on 39. A single region cannot describe it; the multi-region form (see cardia) can, but wants a second correspondence on map 17 to pin down."
 }
